e Edge Malaysia your preferred source on Google\n\nImage: main news image\n\n（吉隆坡26日讯）由于按进度确认集团进行中的发展项目，UOA发展（UOA Development Bhd）第二季净利按年上扬5.98%至1亿2509万令吉，上财年同期报1亿1803万令吉。\n\n该集团今日公布，截至6月杪次季营业额从3亿496万令吉，增12.91%至3亿4433万令吉。\n\nUOA指出，次季的新产业销售约为3亿1880万令吉，主要来自South Link Lifestyle Apartment、Sentul Point Suite Apartment、Desa Green、United Point Residence和其他楼盘。\n\n该集团说，截至6月30日的未入账销售约11亿7000万令吉。\n\n累积2019财政年首半年，UOA净赚1亿8495万令吉，较一年前的1亿5031万令吉，按年增长23.05%；营业额扬23.49%至5亿8900万令吉，同期为4亿7695万令吉。\n\n展望未来，UOA称，将继续专注于目标地理位置的发展，并继续评估符合标准的土地收购机会。\n\n休市时，该股平盘挂于2.07令吉，共4900股易手，市值达40亿7000万令吉。--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nUnited Overseas Australia LtdANNUAL (https://uoa.com.my/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/UOA-Ltd-Annual-Report-2019.pdf)\nciteturn366search14 [wordlim: 200] Published: 6 months ago; UNITED OVERSEAS AUSTRALIA LTD | Annual Report 2019Notes to the Financial Statements ...     <tr><td>- UOA Properties Sdn Bhd*</td><td>Malaysia</td><td></td><td>70.25</td><td>69.99</td></tr> ...     <tr><td>- Scenic Point Development Sdn Bhd*</td><td>Malaysia</td><td>16(c)</td><td>42.15</td><td>41.99</td></tr>\n66\nUNITED OVERSEAS AUSTRALIA LTD | Annual Report 2019Notes to the Financial Statements\nfor the Year Ended 31 December 2019\n(cont’d)16.  INVESTMENT IN SUBSIDIARY COMPANIES (CONT’D)(a)    Details of subsidiary companies are as follows:  (cont’d)<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th>Name of the subsidiary companies</th>\n      <th>Country of incorporation and principal place of business</th>\n      <th>Notes</th>\n      <th>Ownership interest held by Group<br>2019 %</th>\n      <th>2018 %</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr><td>- Tiarawoods Sdn Bhd*</td><td>Malaysia</td><td></td><td>70.25</td><td>69.99</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>- Kumpulan Sejahtera Sdn Bhd*</td><td>Malaysia</td><td></td><td>70.25</td><td>69.99</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>- Windsor Triumph Sdn Bhd*</td><td>Malaysia</td><td></td><td>70.25</td><td>69.99</td></tr>\n    <tr><t